      "side": 1,
      "message": "i considered swapping `fmap` and `ro-frid` in binman.dtsi, but decided\nagainst it because it would affect most boards and i had\na hard time convincing myself it would be harmless.\n\nif reviewers agree swapping the order would be OK, i\u0027d be happy to change it.",
