      "writtenOn": "2024-01-11T22:57:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The `ro-frid` is floating, depending on the size of `ro-fw`. Its offset is described in the `fmap` which is in the same RO. When doing a RO update, both the `ro-frid` and the `fmap` are updated. The new offset is used.\n\nMoving the `rw-frid` is concerned. The offset of the `rw-frid` is described in the `fmap` which is in the RO. Its offset should not change once FSI. So we set the `rw-frid` a fixed offset or pointing to `current_image_data`.\n\nI am fine with moving the `ro-frid`.",
      "parentUuid": "40bcc191_21c34a16",
